.DS_Store
*.log
Crimson-Police/web/.vite/
# database-off saves (Config.Database.enabled = false): server data, never committed. The folders backups and
# audit exports go into ship empty (a .gitkeep each): FXServer cannot create folders on Linux.
Crimson-Police/saves/*
!Crimson-Police/saves/README.md
!Crimson-Police/saves/_backups/
Crimson-Police/saves/_backups/*
!Crimson-Police/saves/_backups/.gitkeep
!Crimson-Police/saves/exports/
Crimson-Police/saves/exports/*
!Crimson-Police/saves/exports/.gitkeep
